<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Shared Technologies.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Shared Technologies.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SBC Warburg said it started coverage of Shared Technologies Fairchild Inc with a buy.</p>
<p>-- In a report, it noted the company's recent merger with Fairchild Corp has created the nation's largest shared tenant services company and the &quot;1996 Telecommunications Act should lead to higher margins and greater opportunities.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The stock ended Monday at 7-1/2.</p>
</text>
